    },
    "//overrides-comments": {
      "uuid@<14": "Audit fix: missing buffer bounds check in uuid v3/v5/v6 (https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq). Keeps any transitive dependency from resolving a vulnerable uuid below 14; the named import shape is unchanged across v3-v14.",
      "@tanstack/history": "Supply-chain pin: @tanstack/history was among the 42 packages compromised on 2026-05-11 (GHSA-g7cv-rxg3-hmpx). Malicious versions 1.161.9 and 1.161.12 were published; 1.161.6 is the last known-good version. Pin to exact version to prevent lockfile drift into a compromised release.",
      "@anthropic-ai/sdk@<0.91.1": "Audit fix: insecure default file permissions in local filesystem memory tool (https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-typescript/security/advisories/GHSA-p7fg-763f-g4gf, affected >= 0.79.0). Reaches us transitively as @agentclientprotocol/claude-agent-acp -> @anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk@0.2.132 -> @anthropic-ai/sdk@0.81.0. Override is safe: claude-agent-acp is a devDependency and the review-queue daemon never uses the filesystem memory tool that's vulnerable. Patched in 0.91.1."
    },
